{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Crea una sección Hero para Shopify con las siguientes especificaciones:
    
    MEDIA DE FONDO
    - Toggle en el schema para elegir entre "Imagen" o "Video" como fondo (select con opciones image/video)
    - Si es imagen: dos campos image_picker separados — "Imagen Desktop" y "Imagen Mobile" (no usar la misma imagen recortada con CSS, deben ser dos uploads independientes)
    - Si es video: campo video (Shopify video picker) o video_url para embed externo, con autoplay, loop, muted y sin controles
    - El media de fondo debe usar aspect-ratio CSS, no alto fijo en px:
      - Desktop (min-width: 750px): aspect-ratio: 1920 / 700
      - Mobile (max-width: 749px): aspect-ratio: 1080 / 1350
    - object-fit: cover en ambos casos para que no se deforme
    - Si no hay media cargado, fallback a un color de fondo sólido configurable
    
    CONTENIDO SOBRE EL MEDIA
    - Overlay opcional con opacidad configurable (range 0-100) para mejorar contraste del texto
    - Heading (richtext o texto simple)
    - Subheading/descripción (richtext)
    - Hasta 2 botones CTA, cada uno con texto, link y estilo (primary/secondary)
    - Control de alineación de texto: izquierda, centro, derecha (select)
    - Control de posición vertical del contenido: arriba, centro, abajo
    
    ESTRUCTURA TÉCNICA
    - Usar el prefijo de clases CSS fh-* (ej: fh-hero-media, fh-hero-content, fh-hero-overlay)
    - Schema completo con todos los campos editables desde el theme editor
    - Debe seguir la paleta de marca: verde oscuro #1B4332, verde medio #2D6A4F, verde claro #74C69D, crema #FAFDF8
    - Tipografía: Fraunces para el heading, DM Sans para subheading y botones
    - Mobile: el contenido debe poder leerse cómodamente dentro del espacio vertical 4:5 sin que el texto se corte
    
    NO HACER
    - No uses una sola imagen recortada por CSS para los dos breakpoints
    - No fijes alturas en px directamente, usa aspect-ratio
    - No quites la opción de fallback a color sólido si no hay media, Crea una sección Hero Slider/Carousel para Shopify con las siguientes especificaciones:
    
    ESTRUCTURA: BLOCKS REPETIBLES (no un solo media fijo)
    - La sección usa "blocks" de Shopify (type: "slide"), permitiendo agregar, eliminar y reordenar slides desde el editor
    - Cada slide (block) es independiente y tiene:
      - Select "Tipo de media" con opciones: Imagen / Video
      - Si es Imagen: dos image_picker — "Imagen Desktop" y "Imagen Mobile" (uploads separados, no recorte por CSS)
      - Si es Video: video picker nativo de Shopify (o video_url para externo), autoplay, loop, muted, sin controles
      - Heading propio del slide (texto o richtext)
      - Subheading/descripción propia del slide
      - Hasta 2 botones CTA por slide (texto, link, estilo primary/secondary)
      - Alineación de texto del slide: izquierda/centro/derecha
      - Posición vertical del contenido: arriba/centro/abajo
      - Overlay opcional por slide (range 0-100 de opacidad)
    
    DIMENSIONES DEL CONTENEDOR (igual para todos los slides, fijo a nivel sección)
    - Usar aspect-ratio, no alto fijo en px
    - Desktop (min-width: 750px): aspect-ratio: 1920 / 700
    - Mobile (max-width: 749px): aspect-ratio: 1080 / 1350
    - object-fit: cover en imágenes y videos
    
    NAVEGACIÓN DEL CAROUSEL
    - Flechas prev/next (mostrar/ocultar configurable, settings.show_arrows)
    - Dots/indicadores de posición (mostrar/ocultar configurable)
    - Autoplay configurable: toggle on/off + velocidad en segundos (range)
    - Pausa el autoplay al hacer hover (desktop) o al tocar (mobile)
    - Swipe nativo en mobile (touch events)
    - Transición tipo fade o slide (select para elegir)
    - Accesibilidad: pausar autoplay si prefers-reduced-motion está activo, aria-labels en flechas y dots
    
    ESTRUCTURA TÉCNICA
    - Prefijo de clases CSS fh-* (ej: fh-hero-slider, fh-hero-slide, fh-hero-dots, fh-hero-arrow)
    - Schema completo: section settings (autoplay, velocidad, mostrar flechas, mostrar dots) + block settings (uno por slide, como se detalla arriba)
    - Mínimo 1 slide, sin límite máximo razonable (o limit: 6 si quieres controlar peso de página)
    - Paleta de marca: verde oscuro #1B4332, verde medio #2D6A4F, verde claro #74C69D, crema #FAFDF8
    - Tipografía: Fraunces para heading, DM Sans para subheading y botones
    - El contenido de cada slide debe leerse cómodamente en el espacio vertical 4:5 de mobile sin cortarse
    
    NO HACER
    - No uses un solo media fijo — debe ser sistema de blocks repetibles
    - No recortes una sola imagen por CSS para los dos breakpoints, cada slide necesita su propio upload desktop/mobile
    - No fijes alturas en px, usa aspect-ratio
    - No cargues todos los videos de todos los slides en simultáneo (lazy load, solo el video activo reproduce)
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .fh-hero-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: block;
  }

  .fh-hero-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .fh-hero-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: 1920 / 700;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: 1080 / 1350;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-slides-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, visibility 0.6s ease;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}.fh-hero-slide-active-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}.fh-hero-slide-transition-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transition: transform 0.6s ease, opacity 0.6s ease, visibility 0.6s ease;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}.fh-hero-slide-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateX(-100%);
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}.fh-hero-slide-next-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateX(100%);
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-image-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .fh-hero-slide-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.fallback_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-slide-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 16px;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 800px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-slide-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-slide-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-slide-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-mobile-only-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .fh-hero-desktop-only-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-mobile-only-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .fh-hero-desktop-only-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    z-index: 10;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
    border: none;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(-50%) scale(1.1);
  }

  .fh-hero-arrow-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    left: 20px;
  }

  .fh-hero-arrow-next-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    right: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .fh-hero-arrow-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: 10px;
    }

    .fh-hero-arrow-next-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      right: 10px;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .fh-hero-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .fh-hero-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 20px;
      gap: 10px;
    }
  }

  .fh-hero-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_color }};
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    opacity: 0.5;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .fh-hero-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .fh-hero-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.fh-hero-dot-active-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.3);
  }

  .fh-hero-slide-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .fh-hero-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<fh-hero-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="fh-hero-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}"
  data-autoplay-speed="{{ block.settings.autoplay_speed }}"
  data-transition="{{ block.settings.transition_type }}"
  data-slide-count="{{ block.settings.slide_images | size }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="fh-hero-slider-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="fh-hero-slides-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% assign slide_data = '1,2,3' | split: ',' %}
      {% for i in slide_data %}
        {% assign slide_num = forloop.index %}
        {% assign media_type_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_media_type' %}
        {% assign image_desktop_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_image_desktop' %}
        {% assign image_mobile_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_image_mobile' %}
        {% assign video_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_video' %}
        {% assign video_url_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_video_url' %}
        {% assign heading_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_heading' %}
        {% assign heading_color_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_heading_color' %}
        {% assign subheading_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_subheading' %}
        {% assign subheading_color_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_subheading_color' %}
        {% assign text_alignment_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_text_alignment' %}
        {% assign vertical_position_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_vertical_position' %}
        {% assign show_overlay_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_show_overlay' %}
        {% assign overlay_opacity_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_overlay_opacity' %}
        {% assign button_1_text_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_1_text' %}
        {% assign button_1_link_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_1_link' %}
        {% assign button_1_bg_color_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_1_bg_color' %}
        {% assign button_1_text_color_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_1_text_color' %}
        {% assign button_2_text_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_2_text' %}
        {% assign button_2_link_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_2_link' %}
        {% assign button_2_text_color_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_button_2_text_color' %}

        {% assign media_type = block.settings[media_type_key] %}
        {% assign image_desktop = block.settings[image_desktop_key] %}
        {% assign image_mobile = block.settings[image_mobile_key] %}
        {% assign video = block.settings[video_key] %}
        {% assign video_url = block.settings[video_url_key] %}
        {% assign heading = block.settings[heading_key] %}
        {% assign heading_color = block.settings[heading_color_key] %}
        {% assign subheading = block.settings[subheading_key] %}
        {% assign subheading_color = block.settings[subheading_color_key] %}
        {% assign text_alignment = block.settings[text_alignment_key] %}
        {% assign vertical_position = block.settings[vertical_position_key] %}
        {% assign show_overlay = block.settings[show_overlay_key] %}
        {% assign overlay_opacity = block.settings[overlay_opacity_key] %}
        {% assign button_1_text = block.settings[button_1_text_key] %}
        {% assign button_1_link = block.settings[button_1_link_key] %}
        {% assign button_1_bg_color = block.settings[button_1_bg_color_key] %}
        {% assign button_1_text_color = block.settings[button_1_text_color_key] %}
        {% assign button_2_text = block.settings[button_2_text_key] %}
        {% assign button_2_link = block.settings[button_2_link_key] %}
        {% assign button_2_text_color = block.settings[button_2_text_color_key] %}

        {% if image_desktop != blank or image_mobile != blank or video != blank or video_url != blank %}
          <div
            class="fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if forloop.first %}fh-hero-slide-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %} {% if block.settings.transition_type == 'slide' %}fh-hero-slide-transition-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}"
            data-slide-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
          >
            <div class="fh-hero-slide-media-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if media_type == 'image' %}
                {% if image_desktop != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 1920 }}"
                    srcset="{{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,
                            {{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,
                            {{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 1500 }} 1500w,
                            {{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 1920 }} 1920w"
                    sizes="100vw"
                    alt="{{ image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
                    loading="{% if forloop.first %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}"
                    width="{{ image_desktop.width }}"
                    height="{{ image_desktop.height }}"
                    class="fh-hero-slide-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-desktop-only-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="fh-hero-slide-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-desktop-only-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if image_mobile != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ image_mobile | image_url: width: 1080 }}"
                    srcset="{{ image_mobile | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w,
                            {{ image_mobile | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,
                            {{ image_mobile | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w"
                    sizes="100vw"
                    alt="{{ image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
                    loading="{% if forloop.first %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}"
                    width="{{ image_mobile.width }}"
                    height="{{ image_mobile.height }}"
                    class="fh-hero-slide-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-mobile-only-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                {% elsif image_desktop != blank %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 1080 }}"
                    srcset="{{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w,
                            {{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,
                            {{ image_desktop | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w"
                    sizes="100vw"
                    alt="{{ image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
                    loading="{% if forloop.first %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}"
                    width="{{ image_desktop.width }}"
                    height="{{ image_desktop.height }}"
                    class="fh-hero-slide-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-mobile-only-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="fh-hero-slide-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-mobile-only-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              {% elsif media_type == 'video' %}
                {% if video != blank %}
                  {{
                    video
                    | video_tag:
                      image_size: '1920x',
                      autoplay: forloop.first,
                      loop: true,
                      muted: true,
                      controls: false,
                      class: 'fh-hero-slide-video-' | append: ai_gen_id,
                      data-video-slide: forloop.index0
                  }}
                {% elsif video_url != blank %}
                  {% if video_url.type == 'youtube' %}
                    <iframe
                      src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ video_url.id }}?autoplay={% if forloop.first %}1{% else %}0{% endif %}&mute=1&loop=1&playlist={{ video_url.id }}&controls=0&showinfo=0&rel=0&modestbranding=1&enablejsapi=1"
                      class="fh-hero-slide-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      data-video-slide="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
                      frameborder="0"
                      allow="autoplay; encrypted-media"
                      allowfullscreen
                      title="Slide {{ forloop.index }} video"
                    ></iframe>
                  {% elsif video_url.type == 'vimeo' %}
                    <iframe
                      src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/{{ video_url.id }}?autoplay={% if forloop.first %}1{% else %}0{% endif %}&muted=1&loop=1&background=1&controls=0"
                      class="fh-hero-slide-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      data-video-slide="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
                      frameborder="0"
                      allow="autoplay; fullscreen"
                      allowfullscreen
                      title="Slide {{ forloop.index }} video"
                    ></iframe>
                  {% endif %}
                {% else %}
                  <div class="fh-hero-slide-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              {% else %}
                <div class="fh-hero-slide-fallback-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              {% if show_overlay %}
                <div
                  class="fh-hero-slide-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});"
                ></div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div
              class="fh-hero-slide-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              style="align-items: {% if vertical_position == 'top' %}flex-start{% elsif vertical_position == 'bottom' %}flex-end{% else %}center{% endif %};"
            >
              <div
                class="fh-hero-slide-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                style="text-align: {{ text_alignment }};"
              >
                {% if heading != blank %}
                  <h2
                    class="fh-hero-slide-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    style="color: {{ heading_color }};"
                  >
                    {{ heading }}
                  </h2>
                {% endif %}

                {% if subheading != blank %}
                  <div
                    class="fh-hero-slide-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    style="color: {{ subheading_color }};"
                  >
                    {{ subheading }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if button_1_text != blank or button_2_text != blank %}
                  <div
                    class="fh-hero-slide-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    style="justify-content: {% if text_alignment == 'center' %}center{% elsif text_alignment == 'right' %}flex-end{% else %}flex-start{% endif %};"
                  >
                    {% if button_1_text != blank %}
                      <a
                        href="{{ button_1_link }}"
                        class="fh-hero-slide-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                        style="background-color: {{ button_1_bg_color }}; color: {{ button_1_text_color }};"
                      >
                        {{ button_1_text }}
                      </a>
                    {% endif %}

                    {% if button_2_text != blank %}
                      <a
                        href="{{ button_2_link }}"
                        class="fh-hero-slide-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                        style="background-color: transparent; color: {{ button_2_text_color }}; border-color: {{ button_2_text_color }};"
                      >
                        {{ button_2_text }}
                      </a>
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% assign total_slides = 0 %}
    {% for i in slide_data %}
      {% assign slide_num = forloop.index %}
      {% assign image_desktop_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_image_desktop' %}
      {% assign image_mobile_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_image_mobile' %}
      {% assign video_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_video' %}
      {% assign video_url_key = 'slide_' | append: slide_num | append: '_video_url' %}
      
      {% if block.settings[image_desktop_key] != blank or block.settings[image_mobile_key] != blank or block.settings[video_key] != blank or block.settings[video_url_key] != blank %}
        {% assign total_slides = total_slides | plus: 1 %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}

    {% if block.settings.show_arrows and total_slides > 1 %}
      <button
        class="fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-arrow-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        aria-label="Slide anterior"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <button
        class="fh-hero-arrow-next-{{ ai_gen_id }} fh-hero-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        aria-label="Siguiente slide"
      >
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.show_dots and total_slides > 1 %}
      <div class="fh-hero-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..total_slides) %}
          <button
            class="fh-hero-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if forloop.first %}fh-hero-dot-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}"
            data-dot-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}"
            aria-label="Ir a slide {{ forloop.index }}"
          ></button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</fh-hero-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FhHeroSlider{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.currentIndex = 0;
        this.slides = [];
        this.autoplayTimer = null;
        this.isPaused = false;
        this.touchStartX = 0;
        this.touchEndX = 0;
        this.prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.slides = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.fh-hero-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }}'));
        this.dots = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('.fh-hero-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}'));
        this.prevButton = this.querySelector('.fh-hero-arrow-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.nextButton = this.querySelector('.fh-hero-arrow-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.autoplay = this.dataset.autoplay === 'true';
        this.autoplaySpeed = parseInt(this.dataset.autoplaySpeed) * 1000;
        this.transitionType = this.dataset.transition;

        if (this.slides.length <= 1) return;

        this.setupEventListeners();
        
        if (this.autoplay && !this.prefersReducedMotion) {
          this.startAutoplay();
        }

        this.playCurrentVideo();
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        if (this.prevButton) {
          this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.goToPrev());
        }

        if (this.nextButton) {
          this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.goToNext());
        }

        this.dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
          dot.addEventListener('click', () => this.goToSlide(index));
        });

        this.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => this.pauseAutoplay());
        this.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => this.resumeAutoplay());

        this.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
          this.touchStartX = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
          this.pauseAutoplay();
        });

        this.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => {
          this.touchEndX = e.changedTouches[0].screenX;
          this.handleSwipe();
          this.resumeAutoplay();
        });
      }

      handleSwipe() {
        const swipeThreshold = 50;
        const diff = this.touchStartX - this.touchEndX;

        if (Math.abs(diff) > swipeThreshold) {
          if (diff > 0) {
            this.goToNext();
          } else {
            this.goToPrev();
          }
        }
      }

      goToSlide(index) {
        if (index === this.currentIndex) return;

        const currentSlide = this.slides[this.currentIndex];
        const nextSlide = this.slides[index];

        this.pauseCurrentVideo();

        if (this.transitionType === 'slide') {
          if (index > this.currentIndex) {
            nextSlide.classList.add('fh-hero-slide-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          } else {
            nextSlide.classList.add('fh-hero-slide-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          }

          setTimeout(() => {
            currentSlide.classList.remove('fh-hero-slide-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
            nextSlide.classList.add('fh-hero-slide-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
            nextSlide.classList.remove('fh-hero-slide-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}', 'fh-hero-slide-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          }, 10);
        } else {
          currentSlide.classList.remove('fh-hero-slide-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
          nextSlide.classList.add('fh-hero-slide-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        }

        this.dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
          dot.classList.toggle('fh-hero-dot-active-{{ ai_gen_id }}', i === index);
        });

        this.currentIndex = index;
        this.playCurrentVideo();
      }

      goToNext() {
        const nextIndex = (this.currentIndex + 1) % this.slides.length;
        this.goToSlide(nextIndex);
      }

      goToPrev() {
        const prevIndex = (this.currentIndex - 1 + this.slides.length) % this.slides.length;
        this.goToSlide(prevIndex);
      }

      startAutoplay() {
        if (this.prefersReducedMotion) return;
        this.autoplayTimer = setInterval(() => {
          if (!this.isPaused) {
            this.goToNext();
          }
        }, this.autoplaySpeed);
      }

      pauseAutoplay() {
        this.isPaused = true;
      }

      resumeAutoplay() {
        this.isPaused = false;
      }

      playCurrentVideo() {
        const currentSlide = this.slides[this.currentIndex];
        const video = currentSlide.querySelector('video');
        
        if (video) {
          video.play().catch(() => {});
        }
      }

      pauseCurrentVideo() {
        const currentSlide = this.slides[this.currentIndex];
        const video = currentSlide.querySelector('video');
        
        if (video) {
          video.pause();
        }
      }

      disconnectedCallback() {
        if (this.autoplayTimer) {
          clearInterval(this.autoplayTimer);
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('fh-hero-slider-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FhHeroSlider{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

